},
{
"t": "Night.",
"s": 1.1,
"e": 1.16
},
{
"t": "A man steps out of the shadows.",
"s": 1.54,
"e": 2.72
},
{
"t": "He is respected, educated, powerful.",
"s": 3.12,
"e": 5.22
},
{
"t": "His name is Nicodemus, and he is about to risk his reputation for one conversation.",
"s": 5.56,
"e": 9.92
},
{
"t": "This is Bible Bits.",
"s": 10.38,
"e": 11.1
},
{
"t": "Things you may have missed.",
"s": 11.52,
"e": 12.24
},
{
"t": "Nicodemus was a Pharisee, a ruler of the Jews, a man of rank with a seat among the leaders.",
"s": 12.6,
"e": 16.86
},
{
"t": "Jesus himself called him a teacher of Israel.",
"s": 17.42,
"e": 19.46
},
{
"t": "He knew the law.",
"s": 19.76,
"e": 20.34
},
{
"t": "He knew the scriptures.",
"s": 20.62,
"e": 21.16
},
{
"t": "But he did not have every answer.",
"s": 21.6,
"e": 22.92
},
{
"t": "The leaders had made up their minds about Jesus.",
"s": 23.26,
"e": 24.88
},
{
"t": "Nicodemus had watched the miracles.",
"s": 25.36,
"e": 26.76
},
{
"t": "He was not so sure.",
"s": 27.2,
"e": 28.08
},
{
"t": "So he came to Jesus at night.",
"s": 28.08,
"e": 29.7
},
{
"t": "Why at night?",
"s": 30.2,
"e": 30.66
},
{
"t": "The Bible does not say.",
"s": 30.9,
"e": 31.7
},
{
"t": "People say it was fear.",
"s": 31.92,
"e": 32.82
},
{
"t": "Maybe it was.",
"s": 33.12,
"e": 33.56
},
{
"t": "We do not know.",
"s": 33.86,
"e": 34.38
},
{
"t": "But he came.",
"s": 34.58,
"e": 35.04
},
{
"t": "He begins with respect.",
"s": 35.32,
"e": 36.24
},
{
"t": "Rabbi, we know you are a teacher.",
"s": 36.76,
"e": 38.06
},
{
"t": "Come from God.",
"s": 38.28,
"e": 38.8
},
{
"t": "Jesus answers with something he did not expect.",
"s": 39.14,
"e": 40.94
},
{
"t": "You must be born again.",
"s": 41.24,
"e": 42.3
},
{
"t": "The Greek word is anothin.",
"s": 42.6,
"e": 44.0
},
{
"t": "It means again.",
"s": 44.28,
"e": 45.08
},
{
"t": "It also means from above.",
"s": 45.42,
"e": 46.82
},
{
"t": "Nicodemus asks how a man can enter his mother's womb a second time.",
"s": 47.2,
"e": 50.0
},
{
"t": "It was a fair question.",
"s": 50.26,
"e": 50.98
},
{
"t": "Jesus explains.",
"s": 51.4,
"e": 52.02
},
{
"t": "Not a second birth of the body.",
"s": 52.56,
"e": 53.68
},
{
"t": "A new beginning.",
"s": 53.96,
"e": 54.48
},
{
"t": "From the spirit.",
"s": 54.84,
"e": 55.28
},
{
"t": "Then the story goes quiet.",
"s": 55.68,
"e": 56.78
},
{
"t": "No big decision.",
"s": 56.78,
"e": 57.8
},
{
"t": "No public stand.",
"s": 57.98,
"e": 58.74
},
{
"t": "The Bible says nothing more of Nicodemus for some time.",
"s": 59.1,
"e": 61.46
},
{
"t": "Then the leaders want Jesus arrested.",
"s": 61.74,
"e": 63.48
},
{
"t": "In a room full of his colleagues, one voice speaks up.",
"s": 63.8,
"e": 66.32
},
{
"t": "Does our law judge a man before it hears him?",
"s": 66.64,
"e": 68.3
},
{
"t": "They turn on him.",
"s": 68.52,
"e": 69.2
},
{
"t": "Are you from Galilee too?",
"s": 69.48,
"e": 70.44
},
{
"t": "Nicodemus says no more.",
"s": 70.74,
"e": 71.78
},
{
"t": "Then comes the cross.",
"s": 72.06,
"e": 72.92
},
{
"t": "The disciples have scattered.",
"s": 73.32,
"e": 74.16
},
{
"t": "Jesus is dead.",
"s": 74.48,
"e": 75.14
},
{
"t": "Two men step forward to bury him.",
"s": 75.42,
"e": 76.92
},
{
"t": "Joseph of Arimathea and Nicodemus.",
"s": 77.4,
"e": 79.46
},
{
"t": "He brings about a hundred pounds of myrrh and allos.",
"s": 79.68,
"e": 82.28
},
{
"t": "Roughly 75 pounds today.",
"s": 82.6,
"e": 83.96
},
{
"t": "It is an enormous gift.",
"s": 84.2,
"e": 85.2
},
{
"t": "John even reminds us who he is.",
"s": 85.2,
"e": 86.86
},
{
"t": "The man who first came to Jesus by night.",
"s": 87.12,
"e": 88.84
},
{
"t": "Now he comes in daylight, carrying the weight in front of everyone.",
"s": 89.12,
"e": 91.84
},
{
"t": "And that is the last the Bible tells us.",
"s": 92.1,
"e": 93.64
},
{
"t": "Only John records Nicodemus.",
"s": 93.84,
"e": 95.14
},
{
"t": "Three scenes.",
"s": 95.42,
"e": 95.84
},
{
"t": "A night visit.",
"s": 96.18,
"e": 96.62
},
{
"t": "A defense.",
"s": 96.9,
"e": 97.24
},
{
"t": "A burial.",
"s": 97.54,
"e": 97.86
},
{
"t": "We do not know what became of him after.",
"s": 98.16,
"e": 99.6
},
{
"t": "But look at the ark.",
"s": 99.84,
"e": 100.82
},
{
"t": "A man full of questions.",
"s": 101.04,
"e": 102.26
},
{
"t": "Quiet for a time.",
"s": 102.86,
"e": 103.56
},
{
"t": "Then standing in the open.",
"s": 103.84,
"e": 105.12
},
{
"t": "Faith can grow slowly.",
"s": 105.64,
"e": 106.62
},
{
"t": "Courage can too.",
"s": 107.1,
"e": 107.68
},
{
"t": "Bible bits.",
"s": 108.3,
"e": 108.72
},
{
"t": "Things you may have missed.",
"s": 109.14,
"e": 109.84
},
{
"t": "If you enjoyed this story, like and subscribe.",
"s": 110.14,
